// OG card claims, per route.
//
// **The cards are Latin-only in both locales, on purpose.**
//
// HANDOFF-NOTES gap #4 read this as a missing font. It isn't — vendoring Noto
// Sans Bengali and handing it to next/og renders the glyphs but does not shape
// them: satori has no Indic reordering, so the i-kar lands after its consonant
// instead of before it and unattached matras come out as dotted circles
// (verified on the /bn home card). A wrong-looking Bangla card is worse than an
// English one, so the bn pages share the English claim until the cards are
// generated by something with a real shaper.
//
// The Bangla lines below are written and ready — swap `ogClaim` to prefer them
// the day the card renderer can shape Bengali.

